# AI-Solution App — Major Overhaul Plan

## Goal

Complete architectural overhaul of the AI-Solution mobile app to:
1. **Replace AsyncStorage with SQLite** (`expo-sqlite`) for a proper relational database
2. **Add Drawer (hamburger menu) navigation** alongside bottom tabs for all roles
3. **Redesign all screens** to match the provided blue/white UI reference designs
4. **Fix critical bugs** and **add all missing features** (sales rep registration, profile editing, feedback, inquiries, login history, reports)

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database Migration**: Switching from AsyncStorage to SQLite means **all existing test data will be lost**. The new database will start fresh. This is the right approach for production-quality persistence, but any existing test products/users in AsyncStorage will not carry over.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Color Scheme Change**: Based on the design references, the app will switch from the current dark glassmorphism theme to a **blue/white professional theme** (primary blue `#1565C0`, white backgrounds, blue headers). The dark/light toggle will be removed in favor of this clean professional look. Let me know if you want to keep the dark mode option.

> [!WARNING]
> **New Dependencies**: This will require installing `expo-sqlite`, `@react-navigation/drawer`, `react-native-gesture-handler`, `react-native-reanimated`, `expo-image-picker`, and `@expo/vector-icons`. The `expo-blur` dependency will be removed since we're moving away from glassmorphism.

