## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Sales Rep Registration**: From the designs, I see the registration is shared (one form). Should sales reps register from the **same registration form** with a role selector, or should the Admin create sales rep accounts via "Add User" in User Management (like shown in the admin screenshots)?
> 
> I recommend: **Both options** — Sales reps can self-register (pending admin verification), AND admins can create sales rep accounts directly from User Management.

> [!NOTE]
> **Price Field**: The design shows a price field on products (e.g., "P600"). Should prices be in **BWP (Pula)** or should the currency be configurable? I'll default to BWP based on the designs.

